:[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"30 July 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If you are researching kitchen renovation cost in Watford, the first thing to know is that there is no single standard price. A straightforward replacement with the same layout can cost less than a project involving walls, plumbing, electrics, flooring and bespoke storage. The size of the room, specification of the materials and amount of preparation work will all affect the final figure. As a rough guide, typical UK kitchen renovation costs may range from around £3,000 for a limited refresh to £30,000 or more for a substantial, high-specification project. Every project differs, so use these figures only for early budgeting and request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Typical kitchen renovation costs in Watford by scope"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The most useful way to estimate your budget is to define the scope before choosing products. A cosmetic update may involve painting, new handles, worktops or flooring, while a full renovation could include new cabinets, appliances, services and finishes. As a broad guide, a small kitchen with standard products will usually cost less than a larger room with premium appliances, difficult access or extensive building work. Local access, parking and delivery arrangements can also influence the total, particularly where materials need to be carried through a terraced house or upper-floor property."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Kitchen refresh: as a rough typical UK guide, approximately £3,000–£8,000 for decorating, replacement worktops, handles, flooring or selected cabinet and appliance upgrades. This assumes the existing layout and much of the kitchen infrastructure can remain."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Like-for-like kitchen replacement: as a rough typical UK guide, approximately £8,000–£18,000, depending on the cabinets, worktops, sink, appliances and installation required. The range can change considerably with cabinet quality and appliance choices."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Full renovation with layout changes: as a rough typical UK guide, approximately £15,000–£30,000 or more where the room needs new plumbing or electrics, structural alterations, flooring, tiling and a complete installation."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Higher-specification or bespoke kitchen: as a rough typical UK guide, £25,000 upwards may be possible when you choose custom cabinetry, stone worktops, premium appliances, extensive lighting or substantial building work. Every project differs; obtain a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What is included in the labour cost?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Labour is not one single task. A kitchen installation may involve removing and disposing of old units, preparing walls and floors, assembling and securing cabinets, fitting worktops, installing sinks and appliances, connecting services, tiling, decorating and completing trims. Ask whether each of these items is included in the quotation. A low fitting price can become more expensive if removal, waste disposal, floor preparation, finishing panels or final connections are excluded."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Typical labour items to check"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal of existing cabinets, appliances, splashbacks and flooring, including waste disposal."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Cabinet assembly, levelling, fixing, fillers, end panels, plinths and decorative trim."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktop cutting, sink and hob cut-outs, appliance fitting and final adjustments."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plumbing, electrical work, lighting, tiling, plaster repairs, flooring and painting where required."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Protection of access routes and making good after the old kitchen has been removed."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How materials affect the kitchen renovation cost"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Cabinet construction and worktop choice can have a noticeable effect on the budget. Standard pre-made units are generally more economical than made-to-measure cabinetry, while laminate worktops normally cost less than timber, quartz, granite or other stone options. Appliance costs can vary widely, particularly when choosing integrated refrigeration, range cookers or premium extraction. Flooring, wall tiles, splashbacks, sinks, taps, handles and lighting should all be listed separately so you can see where the money is going. If a supplier quote covers cabinets only, it is not yet a complete renovation budget."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Why changing the layout costs more"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Keeping the sink, cooker and dishwasher in broadly the same positions can reduce disruption. Moving them may require new water supplies, waste pipes, electrical circuits, cooker connections or extraction arrangements. Removing a wall or creating a larger opening can add design, support and making-good work, while relocating a doorway may affect flooring and other rooms. Before committing to a layout, check whether the proposed arrangement works with existing windows, doors, radiators, boiler equipment and ventilation. A clear plan can help avoid changes after installation has started."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For a local overview of the work involved, see BMB Renovation’s ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting service in Watford"}],". The company handles all plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation work in-house, alongside other renovation services. This can make it easier to discuss the complete scope in one place, although you should still ask for a written breakdown of exactly what is included and whether specialist design, structural or appliance requirements need separate attention."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Practical ways to budget accurately"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Measure the room and note doors, windows, radiators, boiler units, sockets, water points and extraction before requesting prices."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Decide whether your priority is storage, worktop space, appliances, lighting, appearance or a larger room. This helps direct the budget towards useful improvements."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Prepare a product schedule covering cabinets, worktops, handles, sink, tap, appliances, tiles, flooring, lighting and paint. Mark each item as selected, provisional or still to be chosen."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Request an itemised quotation that separates labour, materials, removal, waste, delivery, preparation and any building work. Check whether VAT is included."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Consider setting aside a contingency for unforeseen work, particularly in older properties or where the condition behind existing units is unclear."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Compare quotations on the same specification rather than comparing totals alone. A cheaper price may omit preparation, finishing work or connections that another contractor has included."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Confirm who is responsible for supplying appliances, checking dimensions, arranging deliveries and dealing with damaged or missing items."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Getting a kitchen renovation quote in Watford"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A useful quote should follow a site visit or a detailed discussion about the room, rather than relying only on a basic estimate from a few measurements. Show the contractor any cabinet plans, appliance models and worktop choices you already have. Explain whether you want a refresh, like-for-like replacement or a different layout, and mention any concerns about damp, flooring, walls or access. BMB Renovation is based at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN, and offers free, no-obligation quotes. You can also review its wider ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/services","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"renovation services"}]," when your kitchen project includes flooring, tiling, carpentry, decorating or other work."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A practical kitchen renovation budget separates essential work from optional upgrades. Address any identified water damage, poor preparation or service issues before choosing optional finishes where possible. You can then control the total by changing cabinet ranges, worktops, handles, appliances or tile formats without redesigning the whole room. Before work begins, confirm the layout, specification, payment stages, programme, waste arrangements and the process for approving variations. If you need a quotation based on your particular Watford property, use the ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"free quote enquiry"}]," and provide as much detail as possible."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get My Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width